examples:
The following example shows how to launch a ball that falls under gravity:

```csharp
ECS.AddSystem<Movement2DSystem>();

int ball = ECS.CreateEntity(new Vector2(100, 100));
ECS.AddComponent<Movement2D>(ball) = new Movement2D { Speed = new Vector2(300, -200), Acceleration = new Vector2(0, 600) };
```
